# Set the role tokens locally using auth.http before sending a protected request.
@apiUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### [L14] Subscribe with a new address (201)
POST {{apiUrl}}/newsletter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "phase2@example.com" }

### [L14] Same subscriber is idempotent (200)
POST {{apiUrl}}/newsletter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": " Phase2@example.com " }

### [L17] Newsletter validation (422)
POST {{apiUrl}}/newsletter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email" }

### [L14] Contact submission (201)
POST {{apiUrl}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Demo Customer", "email": "demo@example.com", "message": "Could you confirm how to care for this finish?" }

### [L18] Malformed JSON keeps the request ID (400)
POST {{apiUrl}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message":

### [L13] Quote using live catalogue prices (200, total 927 on the seed)
# @name phaseTwoProduct
GET {{apiUrl}}/products/chandni-chowk-jhumka

###

POST {{apiUrl}}/pricing/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "productId": "{{phaseTwoProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}", "qty": 1 }],
  "paymentMethod": "cod"
}

### [L18] Invalid quantity (422)
POST {{apiUrl}}/pricing/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "productId": "{{phaseTwoProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}", "qty": 0 }],
  "paymentMethod": "card_mock"
}

### [L17] Customer role is denied before body validation (403)
POST {{apiUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{}

### [L17] The manager reaches body validation (422)
POST {{apiUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{}

### [L15] Read nested MongoDB reviews (200)
GET {{apiUrl}}/products/{{phaseTwoProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}/reviews
